  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>According to Ampere&#39;s circuital law</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8750;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>dl</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi>net</mi></msub></math></p><p>For the closed path&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>OAB</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8750;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>dl</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></msubsup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>dl</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msubsup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>dl</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></msubsup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>dl</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Since the magnetic field is perpendicular to the paths&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>OA</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>BO</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></msubsup><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>dl</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
